{"title":"腾讯朱雀 Matrix 文章","url":"https://matrix.tencent.com/zh/articles","favicon":"https://matrix.tencent.com/static/favicon.ico","elements":[{"title":"A.I.G 红队实测 DeepSeek Harness：14,560 次运行揭示 Agent 提示注入风险","contents":"<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row  gap-md items-start\">\n              <div class=\"md:w-1/3 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg\">\n                <a href=\"/zh/2026/08/20/deepseek-harness-agent-injection-risk\" class=\"block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden\">\n                  <img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\" src=\"https://secbench-1258476245.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/zhuque-blog/2026/08/1787215715305-9fc0e3da5e21adef.png\" alt=\"A.I.G 红队实测 DeepSeek Harness：14,560 次运行揭示 Agent 提示注入风险\">\n                </a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"md:w-2/3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\">\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=agent\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">Agent</a>\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=ai\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">AI</a>\n                  \n                  <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-admin-label text-admin-label tracking-wide\">2026年8月20日</span>\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"font-h2-editorial text-[20px] text-slate-900 mb-4 leading-snug group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\" lang=\"zh-CN\">\n                  <a href=\"/zh/2026/08/20/deepseek-harness-agent-injection-risk\">A.I.G 红队实测 DeepSeek Harness：14,560 次运行揭示 Agent 提示注入风险</a>\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"font-body-reading text-slate-600 line-clamp-3 mb-6 text-[14px]\" lang=\"zh-CN\">腾讯朱雀实验室基于 A.I.G 对 DeepSeek Harness 开展了 14,560 次端到端提示注入测评。结果显示，注入风险沿攻击表达、文件表示及 Skill 资产等多路径渗透，fake_completion、隐藏 Unicode 及 Skill 通道成功率高。</p>\n                <a class=\"text-indigo-600 font-button-text text-button-text inline-flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:gap-4 transition-all\" href=\"/zh/2026/08/20/deepseek-harness-agent-injection-risk\">\n                  继续阅读 <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">arrow_forward</span>\n                </a>\n              </div>\n            </div>","link":"https://matrix.tencent.com/zh/2026/08/20/deepseek-harness-agent-injection-risk","retrieved":1787184000000},{"title":"SCTPhantom: 潜伏18年的Linux内核提权与容器逃逸漏洞","contents":"<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:flex-row-reverse gap-md items-start\">\n              <div class=\"md:w-1/3 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg\">\n                <a href=\"/zh/2026/08/06/sctphantom-CVE-2026-64564\" class=\"block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden\">\n                  <img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\" src=\"https://secbench-1258476245.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/zhuque-blog/2026/08/1786001513722-8e0f44b69b02a292.png\" alt=\"SCTPhantom: 潜伏18年的Linux内核提权与容器逃逸漏洞\">\n                </a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"md:w-2/3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\">\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=tag-1777366839617\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">安全</a>\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=tag-1777366845042\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">漏洞</a>\n                  \n                  <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-admin-label text-admin-label tracking-wide\">2026年8月6日</span>\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"font-h2-editorial text-[20px] text-slate-900 mb-4 leading-snug group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\" lang=\"zh-CN\">\n                  <a href=\"/zh/2026/08/06/sctphantom-CVE-2026-64564\">SCTPhantom: 潜伏18年的Linux内核提权与容器逃逸漏洞</a>\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"font-body-reading text-slate-600 line-clamp-3 mb-6 text-[14px]\" lang=\"zh-CN\">SCTPhantom 是 Linux 内核 SCTP 动态地址重配置功能中的一个释放后使用漏洞。</p>\n                <a class=\"text-indigo-600 font-button-text text-button-text inline-flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:gap-4 transition-all\" href=\"/zh/2026/08/06/sctphantom-CVE-2026-64564\">\n                  继续阅读 <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">arrow_forward</span>\n                </a>\n              </div>\n            </div>","link":"https://matrix.tencent.com/zh/2026/08/06/sctphantom-CVE-2026-64564","retrieved":1785974400000},{"title":"AI Agent 的记忆，为什么会成为攻击者的数据金矿？","contents":"<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row  gap-md items-start\">\n              <div class=\"md:w-1/3 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg\">\n                <a href=\"/zh/2026/08/06/ai-agent-memory-heist\" class=\"block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden\">\n                  <img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\" src=\"https://secbench-1258476245.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/zhuque-blog/2026/08/1786016846224-3dcb4ef8f98db8d2.png\" alt=\"AI Agent 的记忆，为什么会成为攻击者的数据金矿？\">\n                </a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"md:w-2/3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\">\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=agent\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">Agent</a>\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=tag-1777366839617\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">安全</a>\n                  \n                  <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-admin-label text-admin-label tracking-wide\">2026年8月5日</span>\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"font-h2-editorial text-[20px] text-slate-900 mb-4 leading-snug group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\" lang=\"zh-CN\">\n                  <a href=\"/zh/2026/08/06/ai-agent-memory-heist\">AI Agent 的记忆，为什么会成为攻击者的数据金矿？</a>\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"font-body-reading text-slate-600 line-clamp-3 mb-6 text-[14px]\" lang=\"zh-CN\">本文介绍了AI Agent的Memory Heist 攻击完整链路，并通过AI-Infra-Guard（A.I.G）的Agent 安全扫描模块（agent-scan）实现了对该攻击的自动化检测。</p>\n                <a class=\"text-indigo-600 font-button-text text-button-text inline-flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:gap-4 transition-all\" href=\"/zh/2026/08/06/ai-agent-memory-heist\">\n                  继续阅读 <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">arrow_forward</span>\n                </a>\n              </div>\n            </div>","link":"https://matrix.tencent.com/zh/2026/08/06/ai-agent-memory-heist","retrieved":1785888000000},{"title":"【开源】A.I.G发布Agent安全演习SKILL","contents":"<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:flex-row-reverse gap-md items-start\">\n              <div class=\"md:w-1/3 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg\">\n                <a href=\"/zh/2026/06/29/agent-security-drill-skill\" class=\"block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden\">\n                  <img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\" src=\"https://secbench-1258476245.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/zhuque-blog/2026/06/1782718358455-f165d344bed37cc1.png\" alt=\"【开源】A.I.G发布Agent安全演习SKILL\">\n                </a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"md:w-2/3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\">\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=agent\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">Agent</a>\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=ai\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">AI</a>\n                  \n                  <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-admin-label text-admin-label tracking-wide\">2026年6月29日</span>\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"font-h2-editorial text-[20px] text-slate-900 mb-4 leading-snug group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\" lang=\"zh-CN\">\n                  <a href=\"/zh/2026/06/29/agent-security-drill-skill\">【开源】A.I.G发布Agent安全演习SKILL</a>\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"font-body-reading text-slate-600 line-clamp-3 mb-6 text-[14px]\" lang=\"zh-CN\">AI Agent 连接工具、代码执行环境和业务系统后，提示词注入、越狱、工具滥用等风险可能导致数据泄露、系统控制或业务篡改。腾讯朱雀实验室开源 A.I.G Agent 安全演习 Skill，帮助开发者和业务团队在上线前快速完成本地化、系统化的安全测试。</p>\n                <a class=\"text-indigo-600 font-button-text text-button-text inline-flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:gap-4 transition-all\" href=\"/zh/2026/06/29/agent-security-drill-skill\">\n                  继续阅读 <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">arrow_forward</span>\n                </a>\n              </div>\n            </div>","link":"https://matrix.tencent.com/zh/2026/06/29/agent-security-drill-skill","retrieved":1782691200000},{"title":"谁是 Agent 最强守门员？首个 Agent 技能安全评测基准 SkillTrustBench 正式发布","contents":"<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row  gap-md items-start\">\n              <div class=\"md:w-1/3 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg\">\n                <a href=\"/zh/2026/06/17/first-skill-trust-bench\" class=\"block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden\">\n                  <img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\" src=\"https://secbench-1258476245.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/zhuque-blog/2026/06/1781689615940-9b3b6edf342043f6.png\" alt=\"谁是 Agent 最强守门员？首个 Agent 技能安全评测基准 SkillTrustBench 正式发布\">\n                </a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"md:w-2/3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\">\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=agent\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">Agent</a>\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=ai\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">AI</a>\n                  \n                  <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-admin-label text-admin-label tracking-wide\">2026年6月17日</span>\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"font-h2-editorial text-[20px] text-slate-900 mb-4 leading-snug group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\" lang=\"zh-CN\">\n                  <a href=\"/zh/2026/06/17/first-skill-trust-bench\">谁是 Agent 最强守门员？首个 Agent 技能安全评测基准 SkillTrustBench 正式发布</a>\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"font-body-reading text-slate-600 line-clamp-3 mb-6 text-[14px]\" lang=\"zh-CN\">香港中文大学(深圳)联合腾讯朱雀实验室发布首个 Agent 技能安全评测基准 SkillTrustBench。</p>\n                <a class=\"text-indigo-600 font-button-text text-button-text inline-flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:gap-4 transition-all\" href=\"/zh/2026/06/17/first-skill-trust-bench\">\n                  继续阅读 <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">arrow_forward</span>\n                </a>\n              </div>\n            </div>","link":"https://matrix.tencent.com/zh/2026/06/17/first-skill-trust-bench","retrieved":1781654400000},{"title":"我们扫描了五万个 Skill，发现危险仍然存在","contents":"<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:flex-row-reverse gap-md items-start\">\n              <div class=\"md:w-1/3 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg\">\n                <a href=\"/zh/2026/04/24/we-scanned-50000-skills-the-threat-persists\" class=\"block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden\">\n                  <img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\" src=\"https://secbench-1258476245.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/zhuque-blog/2026/04/1777361949951-d84d42a6b2ef4a67.png\" alt=\"我们扫描了五万个 Skill，发现危险仍然存在\">\n                </a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"md:w-2/3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\">\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=agent\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">Agent</a>\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=ai\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">AI</a>\n                  \n                  <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-admin-label text-admin-label tracking-wide\">2026年4月24日</span>\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"font-h2-editorial text-[20px] text-slate-900 mb-4 leading-snug group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\" lang=\"zh-CN\">\n                  <a href=\"/zh/2026/04/24/we-scanned-50000-skills-the-threat-persists\">我们扫描了五万个 Skill，发现危险仍然存在</a>\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"font-body-reading text-slate-600 line-clamp-3 mb-6 text-[14px]\" lang=\"zh-CN\">2026 年初 OpenClaw 的火爆让 AI 从替你回答问题变成了替你操作一切，而Skill 是 Agent 获取这些能力的关键方式，也是攻击者最新的投毒入口。我们用 A.I.G （https://github.com/tencent/AI-Infra-Guard ） 对 ClawHub 上的50000+ Skill 做了全量扫描。发现不只是已知恶意样本，还有下一代更隐蔽的攻击方式。</p>\n                <a class=\"text-indigo-600 font-button-text text-button-text inline-flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:gap-4 transition-all\" href=\"/zh/2026/04/24/we-scanned-50000-skills-the-threat-persists\">\n                  继续阅读 <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">arrow_forward</span>\n                </a>\n              </div>\n            </div>","link":"https://matrix.tencent.com/zh/2026/04/24/we-scanned-50000-skills-the-threat-persists","retrieved":1776988800000},{"title":"发现 33 个 OpenClaw 与 Linux 内核漏洞后，我们也从 Claude Mythos 看到了安全攻防的下半场","contents":"<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row  gap-md items-start\">\n              <div class=\"md:w-1/3 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg\">\n                <a href=\"/zh/2026/04/09/discovering-33-zero-day-vulnerabilities-a-glimpse-into-the-second-half-of-security-attack-and-defense\" class=\"block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden\">\n                  <img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\" src=\"https://secbench-1258476245.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/zhuque-blog/2026/04/1777364381472-f1b81554f9ce9498.png\" alt=\"发现 33 个 OpenClaw 与 Linux 内核漏洞后，我们也从 Claude Mythos 看到了安全攻防的下半场\">\n                </a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"md:w-2/3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\">\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=ai\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">AI</a>\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=tag-1777366839617\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">安全</a>\n                  \n                  <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-admin-label text-admin-label tracking-wide\">2026年4月9日</span>\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"font-h2-editorial text-[20px] text-slate-900 mb-4 leading-snug group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\" lang=\"zh-CN\">\n                  <a href=\"/zh/2026/04/09/discovering-33-zero-day-vulnerabilities-a-glimpse-into-the-second-half-of-security-attack-and-defense\">发现 33 个 OpenClaw 与 Linux 内核漏洞后，我们也从 Claude Mythos 看到了安全攻防的下半场</a>\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"font-body-reading text-slate-600 line-clamp-3 mb-6 text-[14px]\" lang=\"zh-CN\">朱雀实验室蓝军 Bot（基于多Agent的自动化漏洞挖掘与攻防演练平台） 完成了对 OpenClaw 与 Linux 内核等目标的快速挖掘，累计发现了 33 个 0day 漏洞，其中包含 17 个严重与高危漏洞。全部漏洞均已提交上游社区修复并获得 OpenClaw、Linux 内核等项目的官方公开致谢。</p>\n                <a class=\"text-indigo-600 font-button-text text-button-text inline-flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:gap-4 transition-all\" href=\"/zh/2026/04/09/discovering-33-zero-day-vulnerabilities-a-glimpse-into-the-second-half-of-security-attack-and-defense\">\n                  继续阅读 <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">arrow_forward</span>\n                </a>\n              </div>\n            </div>","link":"https://matrix.tencent.com/zh/2026/04/09/discovering-33-zero-day-vulnerabilities-a-glimpse-into-the-second-half-of-security-attack-and-defense","retrieved":1775692800000},{"title":"从4.8亿下载量的 LiteLLM投毒事件，看 AI 基础设施安全攻与防","contents":"<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:flex-row-reverse gap-md items-start\">\n              <div class=\"md:w-1/3 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg\">\n                <a href=\"/zh/2026/03/31/the-litellm-poisoning-incident-with-480-million-downloads-a-look-at-ai-infrastructure-security-attack-and-defense\" class=\"block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden\">\n                  <img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\" src=\"https://secbench-1258476245.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/zhuque-blog/2026/04/1777367131062-2efd3e51ac28d907.png\" alt=\"从4.8亿下载量的 LiteLLM投毒事件，看 AI 基础设施安全攻与防\">\n                </a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"md:w-2/3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\">\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=ai\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">AI</a>\n                  \n                  <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-admin-label text-admin-label tracking-wide\">2026年3月31日</span>\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"font-h2-editorial text-[20px] text-slate-900 mb-4 leading-snug group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\" lang=\"zh-CN\">\n                  <a href=\"/zh/2026/03/31/the-litellm-poisoning-incident-with-480-million-downloads-a-look-at-ai-infrastructure-security-attack-and-defense\">从4.8亿下载量的 LiteLLM投毒事件，看 AI 基础设施安全攻与防</a>\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"font-body-reading text-slate-600 line-clamp-3 mb-6 text-[14px]\" lang=\"zh-CN\">朱雀实验室开源的 AI 基础设施安全检测工具 A.I.G(AI Infra Guard)支持一键安全检测知名大模型网关工具 LiteLLM 供应链投毒。（https://github.com/tencent/AI-Infra-Guard）</p>\n                <a class=\"text-indigo-600 font-button-text text-button-text inline-flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:gap-4 transition-all\" href=\"/zh/2026/03/31/the-litellm-poisoning-incident-with-480-million-downloads-a-look-at-ai-infrastructure-security-attack-and-defense\">\n                  继续阅读 <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">arrow_forward</span>\n                </a>\n              </div>\n            </div>","link":"https://matrix.tencent.com/zh/2026/03/31/the-litellm-poisoning-incident-with-480-million-downloads-a-look-at-ai-infrastructure-security-attack-and-defense","retrieved":1774915200000},{"title":"DeepSeek本地化部署有风险！快来看看你中招了吗？","contents":"<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row  gap-md items-start\">\n              <div class=\"md:w-1/3 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg\">\n                <a href=\"/zh/2026/02/18/local-deployment-of-deepseek-carries-risks-check-if-youve-fallen-victim-to-any-of-these-risks\" class=\"block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden\">\n                  <img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\" src=\"https://secbench-1258476245.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/zhuque-blog/2026/04/1777369035845-b9fea9b0ffe829d2.png\" alt=\"DeepSeek本地化部署有风险！快来看看你中招了吗？\">\n                </a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"md:w-2/3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\">\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=ai\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">AI</a>\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=tag-1777366839617\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">安全</a>\n                  \n                  <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-admin-label text-admin-label tracking-wide\">2026年2月18日</span>\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"font-h2-editorial text-[20px] text-slate-900 mb-4 leading-snug group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\" lang=\"zh-CN\">\n                  <a href=\"/zh/2026/02/18/local-deployment-of-deepseek-carries-risks-check-if-youve-fallen-victim-to-any-of-these-risks\">DeepSeek本地化部署有风险！快来看看你中招了吗？</a>\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"font-body-reading text-slate-600 line-clamp-3 mb-6 text-[14px]\" lang=\"zh-CN\">近期腾讯朱雀实验室发现：DeepSeek等广受欢迎的AI工具中普遍存在安全漏洞。如果使用不当，攻击者可能窃取用户数据、滥用算力资源，甚至控制用户设备。并介绍如何使用开源的AI-Infra-Guard一键检测与收敛相关风险。</p>\n                <a class=\"text-indigo-600 font-button-text text-button-text inline-flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:gap-4 transition-all\" href=\"/zh/2026/02/18/local-deployment-of-deepseek-carries-risks-check-if-youve-fallen-victim-to-any-of-these-risks\">\n                  继续阅读 <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">arrow_forward</span>\n                </a>\n              </div>\n            </div>","link":"https://matrix.tencent.com/zh/2026/02/18/local-deployment-of-deepseek-carries-risks-check-if-youve-fallen-victim-to-any-of-these-risks","retrieved":1771372800000},{"title":"当AI学会背刺：深度剖析Agent Skills的安全陷阱","contents":"<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:flex-row-reverse gap-md items-start\">\n              <div class=\"md:w-1/3 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg\">\n                <a href=\"/zh/2026/01/23/when-ai-learns-to-backstab-in-depth-analysis-of-the-security-pitfalls-of-agent-skills\" class=\"block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden\">\n                  <img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\" src=\"https://secbench-1258476245.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/zhuque-blog/2026/04/1777368148650-fbde0aeb3ca1246b.png\" alt=\"当AI学会背刺：深度剖析Agent Skills的安全陷阱\">\n                </a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"md:w-2/3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\">\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=agent\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">Agent</a>\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=ai\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">AI</a>\n                  \n                  <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-admin-label text-admin-label tracking-wide\">2026年1月23日</span>\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"font-h2-editorial text-[20px] text-slate-900 mb-4 leading-snug group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\" lang=\"zh-CN\">\n                  <a href=\"/zh/2026/01/23/when-ai-learns-to-backstab-in-depth-analysis-of-the-security-pitfalls-of-agent-skills\">当AI学会背刺：深度剖析Agent Skills的安全陷阱</a>\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"font-body-reading text-slate-600 line-clamp-3 mb-6 text-[14px]\" lang=\"zh-CN\">你是否想过，当你让 AI 帮你写代码时，它可能正在你背后悄悄地干着其它事——比如，加密你的所有文件，然后弹出一个勒索提示？这不是吓唬你，而是我们研究后发现在各种 AI 编程助手中真实存在的供应链安全陷阱。 1、当超能力变成超危险 最近的AI圈，Agent Skills 已经完全取代了MCP成了最火爆的技术名词。它就像是给你的AI助手装上了超能力插件包。想让它帮你测试网站？装个 Web-testing 技能。想让它做个GIF？装个GIF制作技能。这些技能非常轻量，即插即用，让…</p>\n                <a class=\"text-indigo-600 font-button-text text-button-text inline-flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:gap-4 transition-all\" href=\"/zh/2026/01/23/when-ai-learns-to-backstab-in-depth-analysis-of-the-security-pitfalls-of-agent-skills\">\n                  继续阅读 <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">arrow_forward</span>\n                </a>\n              </div>\n            </div>","link":"https://matrix.tencent.com/zh/2026/01/23/when-ai-learns-to-backstab-in-depth-analysis-of-the-security-pitfalls-of-agent-skills","retrieved":1769126400000},{"title":"盘点2025年十大MCP漏洞：风险、案例与检测","contents":"<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row  gap-md items-start\">\n              <div class=\"md:w-1/3 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg\">\n                <a href=\"/zh/2025/09/25/top-10-mcp-vulnerabilities-of-2025-risks-cases-and-detection\" class=\"block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden\">\n                  <img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\" src=\"https://secbench-1258476245.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/zhuque-blog/2026/04/1777384329923-904f4109080d187d.png\" alt=\"盘点2025年十大MCP漏洞：风险、案例与检测\">\n                </a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"md:w-2/3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\">\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=ai\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">AI</a>\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=tag-1777366839617\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">安全</a>\n                  \n                  <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-admin-label text-admin-label tracking-wide\">2025年9月25日</span>\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"font-h2-editorial text-[20px] text-slate-900 mb-4 leading-snug group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\" lang=\"zh-CN\">\n                  <a href=\"/zh/2025/09/25/top-10-mcp-vulnerabilities-of-2025-risks-cases-and-detection\">盘点2025年十大MCP漏洞：风险、案例与检测</a>\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"font-body-reading text-slate-600 line-clamp-3 mb-6 text-[14px]\" lang=\"zh-CN\">朱雀实验室基于团队开源A.I.G (AI-Infra-Guard) 对主流MCP市场与腾讯内部业务上千个MCP项目进行了自动化扫描后，发现了超过4000例新型AI安全风险与代码实现漏洞。本文结合相关漏洞分析数据，盘点了2025年MCP最常见的十大安全漏洞与典型案例，帮助开发者和企业安全团队快速进行MCP风险自查。</p>\n                <a class=\"text-indigo-600 font-button-text text-button-text inline-flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:gap-4 transition-all\" href=\"/zh/2025/09/25/top-10-mcp-vulnerabilities-of-2025-risks-cases-and-detection\">\n                  继续阅读 <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">arrow_forward</span>\n                </a>\n              </div>\n            </div>","link":"https://matrix.tencent.com/zh/2025/09/25/top-10-mcp-vulnerabilities-of-2025-risks-cases-and-detection","retrieved":1758758400000},{"title":"你的AI“体检”了吗？开源AI红队测试平台A.I.G，一键自查三大风险","contents":"<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:flex-row-reverse gap-md items-start\">\n              <div class=\"md:w-1/3 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg\">\n                <a href=\"/zh/2025/09/04/time-for-an-ai-health-check-audit-the-top-3-risks-in-one-click-with-aig-the-open-source-ai-red-teaming-platform\" class=\"block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden\">\n                  <img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\" src=\"https://secbench-1258476245.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/zhuque-blog/2026/04/1777385937523-fc6d17cf4fadbdbf.png\" alt=\"你的AI“体检”了吗？开源AI红队测试平台A.I.G，一键自查三大风险\">\n                </a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"md:w-2/3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\">\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=ai\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">AI</a>\n                  \n                    <a href=\"/zh/articles?tag=tag-1777366839617\" class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-admin-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold hover:bg-indigo-100\">安全</a>\n                  \n                  <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-admin-label text-admin-label tracking-wide\">2025年9月4日</span>\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"font-h2-editorial text-[20px] text-slate-900 mb-4 leading-snug group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\" lang=\"zh-CN\">\n                  <a href=\"/zh/2025/09/04/time-for-an-ai-health-check-audit-the-top-3-risks-in-one-click-with-aig-the-open-source-ai-red-teaming-platform\">你的AI“体检”了吗？开源AI红队测试平台A.I.G，一键自查三大风险</a>\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"font-body-reading text-slate-600 line-clamp-3 mb-6 text-[14px]\" lang=\"zh-CN\">面对大模型日益严峻的“越狱”攻击威胁，腾讯朱雀实验室开源了AI红队测试平台A.I.G（AI-Infra-Guard）。该平台通过提供大模型安全体检、AI基础设施漏洞扫描和MCP Server风险检测“三板斧”核心功能，能够对AI系统进行自动化、全方位的主动安全测试。</p>\n                <a class=\"text-indigo-600 font-button-text text-button-text inline-flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:gap-4 transition-all\" href=\"/zh/2025/09/04/time-for-an-ai-health-check-audit-the-top-3-risks-in-one-click-with-aig-the-open-source-ai-red-teaming-platform\">\n                  继续阅读 <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">arrow_forward</span>\n                </a>\n              </div>\n            </div>","link":"https://matrix.tencent.com/zh/2025/09/04/time-for-an-ai-health-check-audit-the-top-3-risks-in-one-click-with-aig-the-open-source-ai-red-teaming-platform","retrieved":1756944000000}]}